<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-BUNDESLIGA CHAMPIONS SINCE 1963.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BUNDESLIGA CHAMPIONS SINCE 1963.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
